      "writtenOn": "2019-03-16T05:33:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Be careful that some chips have CONFIG_FLASH_WRITE_SIZE !\u003d 1, and your code might not work then. In some cases, CONFIG_FLASH_WRITE_SIZE \u003e 8, so you\u0027ll need to write header and data in one go.\n\nAt the very least, make sure to add BUILD_ASSERT to prevent this code from being used on such chips.",
      "revId": "3929f4f23875c7fd3eb7bdb434dafcdde9a34480",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
